<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES HIGHER AT FIX.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES HIGHER AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most Helibor interest rates</p>
<p>were higher at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The three-month rate rose  three basis-points to 3.06 percent.</p>
<p>			  March 18 fix	  March 17 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor	   3.00 pct		3.00 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor	   3.03 pct		3.02 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor	   3.06 pct		3.03 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor	   3.17 pct		3.16 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor	   3.29 pct		3.26 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	  3.42 pct		3.37 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
